{"sections":[{"slug":"Bruhat分解","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Bruhat分解"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Bruhat <span lang=\"zh\">分解</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Bruhat 分解”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Bruhat <span lang=\"zh\">分解是代数群及其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/旗簇","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">旗流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一个分解</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">代数群</span></h2>\n<p>$$\r\nG = \\bigcup_{w\\in S_n} BwB\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">旗簇</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">抽象的旗簇</span> $\\mathrm{Fl}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Borel子群","text":"Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的模空间</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定一个</span> Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子群</span> $B$, <span lang=\"zh\">有一个同构</span> $G/B\\to \\mathrm{Fl}$, $x \\mapsto xBx^{-1}$.</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\mathrm{Fl} \\simeq G/B = \\bigcup_{w\\in W} BwB/B\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}